mes "$")*	KNOWN	= A flag telling whether the given "term" is known for sure*			  or if it is just a guess.  If known for sure ("1"), the*			  term type will be set without prompting the user.   If not*			  known ("0"), the term type will be used as a default and the*			  user will be prompted.  Pressing <ENTER> will accept this*			  default.*term:vga:1			; vgakbd emulated terminalt0:wyse120:1		; Wyse-120 terminalt1:vt100:1			; PCK1 main terminalt*:vt100:0			; Non-dedicated terminal, but assume VT100* Any others go here!